            "start": 154,
            "end": 161
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "10. Thus, for the aforesaid reason, the petition is allowed as a consequence whereof the impugned order No. No. 10/DMP/PSA/23 of 2023 dated 31.03.2023 is quashed and the respondents including the concerned jail authority consequently are di"
      }
    ],
